\end{figure}

Fig.~\ref{fig:curves} shows the same story over training time at $m=0.2,p=0.1$:
FedAvg's BSR climbs and locks in near $1.0$, Krum's oscillates upward, while
GradCos, FLTrust and FLAME keep it near zero for all $100$ rounds.

